					39 00 00 00 00 00 04 FF 5A A5 53
					15 00 00 00 00 00 02 F0 01 // MURA_TUNNING
					//SGOD Ratio setting
					39 00 00 00 00 00 04 FF 5A A5 63
					39 00 00 00 00 00 11 81 80 80 80 4C 40 10 00 00 80 80 80 80 40 10 00 00
					39 00 00 00 00 00 11 82 80 80 80 80 80 40 00 00 80 80 80 80 80 80 00 00
					39 00 00 00 00 00 11 86 00 28 28 34 0C 00 60 50 00 5C 4C 40 3C 00 1C 44
					39 00 00 00 00 00 11 87 00 A8 88 50 40 00 74 60 00 B8 98 70 58 00 28 08
					39 00 00 00 00 00 10 8D 30 10 20 20 00 00 24 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
					39 00 00 00 00 00 10 92 40 40 40 3C 00 60 50 00 74 64 54 5C 00 3C 44
					39 00 00 00 00 00 10 93 D0 B0 70 68 00 9C 78 00 B8 A8 80 68 00 48 30
					39 00 00 00 00 00 10 9E 2C 30 34 18 00 60 50 00 60 4C 3C 3C 00 28 44
					39 00 00 00 00 00 10 9F B0 80 50 40 00 74 60 00 B8 90 68 58 00 38 10
					39 00 00 00 00 00 04 FF 5A A5 53
					15 00 00 00 00 00 02 80 00
					15 00 00 00 00 00 02 F0 00 // MURA_TUNNING
					39 00 00 00 00 00 04 FF 5A A5 21 // PAGE21
